title: "Dense-Evolution: Micro-optimized High-Performance NISQ Statevector Quantum Circuit Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Hardware-adaptive integration of native NumPy, CUDA-accelerated CuPy,
  and linear kernel fusion via JAX JIT/XLA compilation, for high-performance
  NISQ statevector quantum circuit simulation.
